  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "Delighting customers can be a challenge for any organization. The goal here is to understand the processes that lead to customer satisfaction to build customer focused teams.\n\n### Coordinate across departments\n\nCoordinating across functional and geographic silos enables companies to better meet a variety of customer needs. Have discussions with other teams and departments to share insights and brainstorm coherent solutions.\n\n### Build skills\n\nIt is natural for team members to rely on old processes and practices, especially if they not adequately trained on new ones. Whenever the company or team implements a new approach to supporting customers, ensure your team gets re-training to not only comprehend new processes, but begin to feel comfortable with these new processes.",
